 addgoal(x,'Fix public expectations and inform real counterparties|改公众预期并告实际对象','Correct main and old-answer; answer Dana about the retained full lesson and send its actual page privately, and tell the venue the player is actually loaded. Do not claim a render is a public delivery or a venue request is playback.|改main及old-answer，答Dana完整课保留、私发实际页面，告诉场方实际播放器已装。不能把导出说成公开交付，或请求说成已播放。',['main','old-answer','lesson-q','subscriber-dm','venue-dm'])
 base=[lookup(k) for k in ['voice','orders','lesson-rights','public-rights','footage','prepared','producer','public-project','lobby-order','public-history','subscriber','lesson-intake','public-render','lobby-intake','subscriber-service']]
