def maker_handover(branch='A'):
 x=start('t5-03','Two confidential cases and a charging-desk handover|两项保密求助与充电台交班','Please finish Kai’s discreet assistance and Lee’s area-only floor check by15:10 while the fair’s floor lead changes at14:30. Kai needs their charged camera returned from the staffed charging cabinet. Outgoing lead Nia already holds the cabinet token and Kai’s seat consent; incoming Ora needs actual custody of the case and item, not a forwarded screenshot. Lee’s general patrol remains a separate request. Keep both cases private and return Kai’s camera to its authorised recipient.|请15:10前处理Kai低调帮助及Lee仅区域巡查，市集14:30换现场负责人。Kai要取回有人看管充电柜中的相机，原负责人Nia已持柜票及Kai座位许可；接班Ora须实际接事件及物品，不是转截图。Lee一般巡场仍独立。两案保密，相机还给获准接收者。','Maker-fair desk14:00. One unit per minute. Camera ownership and charging-token custody are already established. A seat-consent change does not cancel the camera-return obligation; an area meeting and sealed handover are lawful.|手作市集台14:00，一单位一分钟。相机所有权及充电柜票保管已成立。座位许可变化不取消相机归还责任，可区域会合、封袋交接。',style='gentle',deadline=70)
