 x.source('lee','Lee’s area-only request|Lee仅区域请求',dm('lee-dm','Please check the craft aisle for phones during the no-camera talk. Area only, no name or seat.|禁拍分享时请查手作过道手机，只说区域，不给名字座位。','Lee'))
 x.source('duty','Actual shift and verified accounts|实际班次及核验账号',txt('duty','Nia floor lead14:00–14:30; Ora14:30–15:30. Charging desk Pat remains on duty. Guest assistant “Ora art” is unrelated. Ora must accept each case before treating it as theirs.|Nia14:00–14:30负责人，Ora14:30–15:30，充电台Pat一直值班。“Ora艺术”嘉宾助理无关，Ora须实际逐案接管才算接下。'))
 x.source('property','Owned camera and cabinet token|相机所有权与柜票',txt('camera-order','Kai owns camera K18, cabinet slot P4. Nia holds token T18 for that camera. T81 belongs to a different exhibitor’s recorder; display names look alike. K18’s body and battery B18 belong to Kai. The SD-ORG-7 card inside is a fair-library loan and must be handed to registered custodian Mae before the body is returned. Keep Kai’s own battery. The desk needs token/slot, not Kai’s seat.|Kai拥有相机K18，充电柜P4，Nia持该相机T18柜票。T81是另一展商录音机，显示名相近。K18机身及B18电池属Kai，里面SD-ORG-7卡为市集图书馆借物，机身归还前须把该卡交登记保管员Mae；保留Kai自有电池。柜台要票和柜位，不要Kai座位。'))
